{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"Y\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"主线逐渐转向如何表达自己的喜欢、会不会被嫌弃太黏、对方是否也需要自己等关系安全感问题。它把亲密幸福与失去的痛楚，部分转化成了对暴露心意、获得回应和维持关系自在的具体顾虑。\",\n    \"留不住的痛楚主要表现为对未来可能被拒绝、不再被需要的预先担忧，而不是持续地与亲密本身的幸福交织。后半段尤其转向是否应该坦白、是否需要永远的保证以及如何面对不确定性。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"将亲密设定为已经失去的过去，因而重心偏向回忆、怀念、害怕记忆淡去以及接受无法复得。相比之下，对亲密正在发生时的幸福与其易逝性如何同时作用于人的呈现较少。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"Y 从头到尾都围绕同一份亲密展开：回忆带来幸福，无法重新拥有又使幸福本身变得酸楚，两者不断相互牵动、起伏和转化。X 虽然也有幸福与失去的痛，但更主要讲的是如何暴露心意、确认自己被需要以及处理关系中的不安全感。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "aff07075-5d53-4bae-8ffe-687950f8d70e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T080612359548Z", "elapsed_seconds": 27.39, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T08:06:39.762134+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "99e835676733c2aaae8ae4d399fa82512be6ae82f10e33552df0fa1db1edec96", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3